flowchart TD
    A[Question] --> B[Clarify: user, decision, constraints]
    B --> C[State assumptions]
    C --> D[Propose baseline first]
    D --> E[Choose primary metric + guardrails]
    E --> F[Design: data, model, serving]
    F --> G[Discuss tradeoffs]
    G --> H[Name failure modes]
    H --> I[Monitoring + rollback plan]
    I --> J[Summarize decision]
    J --> K{Follow-up?}
    K -- Yes --> B
    K -- No --> L[Strong signal sent]
